{"id":"631328","name":"豆沙麻球","author":"丽彩（五谷杂粮）","authorId":"12357987","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/631328/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"60克"}],"sub":[{"name":"温水","amount":"170克"},{"name":"泡打粉","amount":"4克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白糖60克。","img":"images/631328/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入170克温水搅拌融化。","img":"images/631328/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"克糯米粉加4克泡打粉倒入糖水中。","img":"images/631328/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"和成面团。","img":"images/631328/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揪适当面剂，按扁放上豆沙。","img":"images/631328/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"收口。","img":"images/631328/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"滚上白芝麻，再用手团一下，让芝麻不容易掉。","img":"images/631328/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜松弛一个小时。","img":"images/631328/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再冷油入油锅，中火慢慢炸。","img":"images/631328/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"等等浮上来。","img":"images/631328/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"用漏勺打转按压。","img":"images/631328/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"等金黄酥脆，捞出。","img":"images/631328/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}